   "title": "3 ad vendors received data before the visitor chose",
   "text": "Your banner asks visitors to choose, but Google Ads / DoubleClick / Floodlight, Microsoft Advertising UET (Bing), Meta (Facebook/Instagram) sent requests before any choice was made; Google Ads / DoubleClick / Floodlight, Microsoft Advertising UET (Bing) did so from Shopify's pixel sandbox, which your consent app's script blocking cannot reach. Shopify's own setting for this visitor's region was \"allowed until the visitor opts out\", so Shopify let the pixels start.",
